[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":96},["ShallowReactive",2],{"blog:archive:10":3},{"posts":4,"total":85,"tags":86,"tag":-1},[5,14,22,31,39,47,55,63,71,79],{"title":6,"link":7,"date":8,"dateTime":9,"description":10,"thumbnail":11,"tags":12},"線上講座 - 簡報力就是你的說服力","\u002Fblog\u002F2018-04-11-keynote-king","2018\u002F04\u002F11","2018-04-11","工作、面試、報告中絕對免不了簡報，好的簡報不僅賞心悅目、提高內容的說服力，並且還能時時提醒自己接下來要介紹的內容，絕對是會議中的一等一神器。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2018%2F01%2Fkeynote_cover.png?alt=media&token=bd37bf3b-dc9f-4ec5-8f01-31e01cfc743f",[13],"event",{"title":15,"link":16,"date":17,"dateTime":18,"description":19,"thumbnail":20,"tags":21},"線上講座 - Node.js 的各種運用","\u002Fblog\u002F2018-01-16-jan-node","2018\u002F01\u002F16","2018-01-16","Node.js 課程中老師介紹了許多基礎的概念，但其實 Node.js 可以運用的層面非常的廣，光只靠老師的一堂課無法涵蓋所有的內容，因此我們從各地尋找優秀的講者，讓同學接觸更多不同的 Node.js 應用概念。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2018%2F01%2Fjan_cover.png?alt=media&token=d3bc0edf-1044-434f-962a-92f9a0c71a88",[13],{"title":23,"link":24,"date":25,"dateTime":26,"description":27,"thumbnail":28,"tags":29},"年紀的追趕下，擁有專業技能，才能踏實完成每一步 -- Chelsea","\u002Fblog\u002F2018-12-04-interview","2018\u002F01\u002F04","2018-01-04","大眾傳播系畢業後，從事廣告公司平面相關，工作的性質比較偏與人溝通想法，沒有實際自己動手完成的經驗，覺得工作總是出一張嘴，感覺很不踏實，在 2016 年國外打工回國後，認為應該培養一技之長，決定踏入前端這個深不見底的大坑(笑)","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2018%2F01%2Finterview_chelsea.jpg?alt=media&token=9b8374ca-1f94-47bc-9c14-d8ca7819afe0",[30],"interview",{"title":32,"link":33,"date":34,"dateTime":35,"description":36,"thumbnail":37,"tags":38},"學習前端半年，畢業即就業 -- 世軒","\u002Fblog\u002F2018-12-03-interview","2018\u002F01\u002F03","2018-01-03","很享受現在的工作生活，連女友的躍躍欲試，開始學習前端了！目前公司的前端、後端人員各一位，沒有前輩帶領的工作有好有壞，我可以獨當一面完成很多事，當然遇到問題無人可以解答時，我也會請教老師(笑)","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2018%2F01%2Finterview_%E4%B8%96%E8%BB%92.jpg?alt=media&token=192b56f8-0917-4d1f-9b3f-454f2902cae2",[30],{"title":40,"link":41,"date":42,"dateTime":43,"description":44,"thumbnail":45,"tags":46},"兩個月保險業務轉職前端，分享如何“學習” -- 引擎","\u002Fblog\u002F2017-12-20-interview","2017\u002F12\u002F20","2017-12-20","引擎，一名保險業務員，只花兩個月成為前端工程師，進入業界。喜愛旅行的他在環遊世界半年間，因緣際會認識了遠端工作者，開始嚮往這樣的工作型態...","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2017%2F12%2Finterview_engine.jpg?alt=media&token=779012a2-9211-4093-9fa3-f63eee9d887a",[30],{"title":48,"link":49,"date":50,"dateTime":51,"description":52,"thumbnail":53,"tags":54},"賣場服務生躍進前端工程師，「學習運用現有資源，解決當前問題！」 -- Joseph","\u002Fblog\u002F2017-12-19-interview","2017\u002F12\u002F19","2017-12-19","Joseph 政治系，未來將走上與本科系相關的工作，在所學領域發光發熱；然而出現了些問題，打亂他的人生規劃，過往工作經歷皆是各式賣場服務業。這讓他決定停下來思考，未來該如何規劃？","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2017%2F12%2Finterview_Joseph.jpg?alt=media&token=514f85f4-5e49-4982-840b-eb9c601e7676",[13],{"title":56,"link":57,"date":58,"dateTime":59,"description":60,"thumbnail":61,"tags":62},"【獎品贈送】參加 ITHome 鐵人賽即贈送實體商品","\u002Fblog\u002F2017-11-30-hexschool-and-ironman","2017\u002F11\u002F30","2017-11-30","ITHome 鐵人賽又開始囉，和老師一起參加鐵人賽，完賽者即贈送六角專屬紀念品～","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fcasper-de5d5.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fimages%2Fblog%2Fironman.png?alt=media&token=84ea9c98-3c70-48b8-90b8-c97273dac570",[13],{"title":64,"link":65,"date":66,"dateTime":67,"description":68,"thumbnail":69,"tags":70},"【直播預告】 Bootstrap 4 超狂額外講座，讓你收穫滿滿一整月","\u002Fblog\u002F2017-09-27-sep-bs","2017\u002F09\u002F27","2017-09-27","Bootstrap 4 額外線上問答，強化同學的 Flex、元件運用、切版要領、Sass 編譯技巧，一同參與百人的線上講座吧！","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2017%2F09%2Fbs4_onlinetalk.png?alt=media&token=80945c5f-d838-4e28-aef9-071e0f9926b4",[13],{"title":72,"link":73,"date":74,"dateTime":75,"description":76,"thumbnail":77,"tags":78},"完成夢想，不一定要冒險？ Grace","\u002Fblog\u002F2017-09-23-wan-ling-interview","2017\u002F09\u002F23","2017-09-23","資工系畢業的 Grace，個性保守的她認為工作應與所學相關，但即便學習了四年，當興趣變成職業，總有些遲疑！訪談過程中，她透露對於設計領域有憧憬，但不敢貿然投入設計領域！接觸前端設計後，結合程式語言與設計，在所學與所愛之間取得平衡。","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2017%2F09%2Fwanling_1200.jpg?alt=media&token=b0253aff-ec76-419b-b8bf-db95548cb7df",[30],{"title":80,"link":81,"date":74,"dateTime":75,"description":82,"thumbnail":83,"tags":84},"如何藉由面試了解自己的價值，海外遊子--雲龍","\u002Fblog\u002F2017-09-23-yunlong-interview","從馬來西亞跨海求學的雲龍，到台灣就讀平面設計，今年應屆畢業！希望能留在台灣，並且有一份好工作，因緣際會看到了六角學院的教學分享影片，投入前端技術的學習，在有限的時間內，結合設計與前端的雙開技能，成功得到了前端工程師的門票","https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2017%2F09%2Fyunlung.jpg?alt=media&token=00be778a-524e-4dad-88cf-46cf3dadff06",[30],116,[87,88,89,90,91,13,30,92,93,94,95],"UI design","course","css","css3","enterprise","javascript","jobs","skilltree","software engineer",1790064291964]